# MetricsTableDiagram

## Import

```svelte
import { MetricsTableDiagram } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<MetricsTableDiagram
  title="example"
/>
```

<div class="live">
<MetricsTableDiagram
  title="example"
/>
</div>

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title?` | `string` | `—` | Caption on the top edge, uppercased. Default "COST". |
| `rows?` | `MetricRow[]` | `—` | — |
| `totalCalls?` | `number | string` | `—` | — |
| `totalTime?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `showTotal?` | `boolean` | `—` | Show the total row. Default true. |
| `class?` | `string` | `—` | — |

## Exported types

- `MetricRow`
- `MetricsTableDiagramProps`
